body=heading('SUMMARY & INTERPRETATION','A result is more useful with context.')+'<div class="cs-summary"><div class="grid g3"><div><span class="cs-caption">Within latency budget</span><div class="cs-metric">20 <small>calls</small></div></div><div><span class="cs-caption">Task success</span><div class="cs-metric">94.2<small>%</small></div></div><div><span class="cs-caption">Cost / successful call</span><div class="cs-metric">$0.084</div></div></div></div><p class="tip">Illustrative values. A latency pass does not establish overall production readiness.</p><div class="grid g2">'+specimen('Answer first','<span class="cs-eyebrow">THE TAKEAWAY</span><h2 style="font-weight:400;font-size:25px">Stay at 20 concurrent calls.</h2><p>The first tested response-time breach appears at 40 calls.</p><div class="cs-observation">At 40 calls · 1.18 s P95 · 18% above budget</div>'+button('Inspect evidence ↗','data-overlay="drawer" style="margin-top:20px"'))+specimen('Evidence & conversation','<div class="chat-bubble"><small>CALLER · 00:18</small>Actually, I only want to refund one item.</div><div class="chat-bubble agent"><small>AGENT · 00:19</small>I will process the full order refund.</div><span class="cs-badge cs-badge-warning">Requested scope was missed</span>','Illustrative failed conversation')+'</div>'+heading('LISTS & TABLES','Records stay readable and selectable.')+'<div class="grid g2">'+specimen('Selectable rows','<button class="list-button selected" data-list-row>Run #128 · v2.4<small>Latest run · 94.2% task success</small></button><button class="list-button" data-list-row>Run #127 · v2.3<small>Previous run · 91.8% task success</small></button><p id="selectedRowStatus">Run #128 selected.</p>')+specimen('A compact table',rows([['Run','Success','State'],['#128','94.2%','<span class="cs-badge cs-badge-warning">Review</span>'],['#127','91.8%','<span class="cs-badge">Baseline</span>'],['#126','90.6%','<span class="cs-badge">Archived</span>']]))+'</div>'+heading('OVERLAYS','Keep the evidence close to the task.')+'<div class="grid g2">'+specimen('Dialog','<p>Use for a bounded choice, short explanation, or confirmation.</p>'+button('Open dialog','data-overlay="dialog"','secondary'))+specimen('Evidence drawer','<p>Use for a longer record, trace, or contextual detail.</p>'+button('Open side panel','data-overlay="drawer"','secondary'))+'</div>'+heading('COMPLETE STATES','Show what happened and what to do next.')+'<div class="grid g3">'+specimen('Loading','<div class="state-demo"><div class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></div><strong>Loading evaluation</strong><div class="skeleton"></div><div class="skeleton" style="width:55%"></div></div>')+specimen('Empty','<div class="state-demo"><strong>No evaluations yet.</strong><p>Your first completed run will appear here.</p>'+button('Create an example','data-toast="Example creation selected"','secondary')+'</div>')+specimen('No results','<div class="state-demo"><strong>No matching runs.</strong><p>Try a wider date range.</p>'+button('Clear example filters','data-toast="Example filters cleared"','text')+'</div>')+specimen('Error','<div class="state-demo"><span class="cs-badge cs-badge-danger">Could not load</span><p>Your saved results are still available.</p>'+button('Try again','id="retryExample"','secondary')+'</div>')+specimen('Success','<div class="state-demo"><span class="cs-badge cs-badge-success">✓ Evaluation saved</span><p>The new result is ready to inspect.</p></div>')+specimen('Stale data','<div class="state-demo"><span class="cs-badge cs-badge-warning">Updated 2 hours ago</span><p>Refresh before making a release decision.</p>'+button('Refresh example','id="refreshExample"','secondary')+'</div>')+'</div>'
